    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Browser Scavenger Hunt\r\n\r\nLet's explore this weather app's data! \r\n\r\n#### Do This:\r\n1. Click the **debug panel button** (the bug icon) then toggle to **Network**.\r\n2. Look in the **Response Data** section to find the raw JSON file. \r\n3. Then answer the scavenger hunt questions in your activity guide.\r\n\r\n:::details [**Where do I find the debug panel button?**]\r\nClick the bug icon on the top right of the page. \r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://images.code.org/94dc204b39691b9515108248e0642911-image-1772148344768.25.25 PM.png\" width=\"50\">\r\n:::\r\n",
